---
title: The grid
description: Thumbnails are never seen alone. Six of them side by side, at the size YouTube shows them, is the only honest test of a style.
eyebrow: Content creation · YouTube
source: src/components/studio.css
---
<p>A thumbnail is read in a grid of strangers’ thumbnails at about 300 pixels wide. What survives that: two lines of big type, one accent, one face, one picture. What does not: a line of small text, three colours, a logo in the middle. Below, the styles at grid size, in the system’s own video cards.</p>
